        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:107%">Includes additional carrying cost recorded in March 2025 per SCPSC Docket No. 2024-319-E, Order No. 2025-215 for environmental operation and maintenance cost deferrals.</span>
